# Pastoria's Move Maniac (decomp scrcmd_party_mon_moves.c, applications/move_reminder.c): for a Heart Scale,
# Bulbasaur remembers Tackle. It knows four moves, so the relearner's screen asks to forget one through the summary
# (Razor Leaf), "1, 2, and... Poof!", and the Heart Scale is handed over. Without one he sends the player away.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_BULBASAUR 30 platinum:MOVE_RAZOR_LEAF platinum:MOVE_VINE_WHIP platinum:MOVE_LEECH_SEED platinum:MOVE_GROWL
give item platinum:ITEM_HEART_SCALE 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_PASTORIA_CITY_EAST_HOUSE 8 5 up
until idle
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until app party
+1 tap slot:0
until app none
advance text
until app move-reminder
+0 assert app move-reminder
+2 screenshot relearner
+2 tap row:0
+2 tap next
+2 tap next
+2 tap yes
until app summary
+2 tap move:0
until app move-reminder
+2 tap yes
+2 tap next
+2 tap next
+2 tap next
+2 tap next
until app none
advance text
until idle
+0 assert state party[0].moves ["platinum:MOVE_TACKLE","platinum:MOVE_VINE_WHIP","platinum:MOVE_LEECH_SEED","platinum:MOVE_GROWL"]
+0 assert state party[0].pp[0] 35
+0 assert state bag.items []
+0 reload
until idle
+0 assert state party[0].moves[0] "platinum:MOVE_TACKLE"
# No Heart Scale left: come back with one.
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text
until idle
+0 assert state party[0].moves[0] "platinum:MOVE_TACKLE"
